    <string name="legend_colors">Red = may be following you. Yellow = on your alert list. White = shown only. Grey = maker match only, could be harmless.</string>
    <string name="legend_size">Bigger icon = stronger signal.</string>
    <string name="legend_rings">Rings = rough distance, guessed from signal strength. Walls, cars and bodies can make it 2–3 times off.</string>
    <string name="legend_filled">Filled = direction found with Find direction. Outline = no direction yet: it sits in its group’s slice of the circle, so the angle tells you the type, not where it is.</string>
    <string name="legend_chips">Tap an icon in the row under the radar to hide or show that group. Trackers still near their owner are left off the radar to cut clutter; they’re still listed below.</string>
